WEBVTT

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:14.320
These are my favorite, Sunrise's strawberry daifuku-

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.120
I'm r-rooting f-for you...

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.210
What are you doing?

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.380
Gachi Pink!

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.970
You got a grudge against her?

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.090
I'm practicing.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.810
A signing and handshake event?

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.560
This looks great!

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.060
This is tomorrow!

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.640
And you were trying to hide it!

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:48.650
What if Gachi Pink doesn't like me?

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.860
Well then, I can help you practice if you want.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:01.450
I-I'm... ruh-ruh-rooting... ffffor you...

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.040
She needs boobies!

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.580
I-I-I...

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.590
Oh c'mon...

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:14.010
It's cause I stayed up all night rehearsing.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:16.680
God's telling you to stay home.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.930
Should I go there for you?

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:22.060
I guess I'll... take your offer.

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.810
A-Are you really sick?

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:29.480
That's right!

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:32.690
Hitoha turns all adorable when she catches a cold!

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:34.820
Get out there right now!

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.780
Well, I'm here...

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:44.700
But... I feel really out of place.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:48.460
Then again, she was a pin-up girl before.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.460
I wonder if any of them are Gachi Rangers fans.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.800
A Gachi glove!

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:02.220
O-Our teacher...!

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:12.360
W-What am I doing? I don't need to hide.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.530
I should just give it up and admit I love the show.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.360
Gachi Pink's crotch!

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:23.120
I'm like a stalker now!

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:28.790
A camera?

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.040
H-He's taking upskirts!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.170
Thank you so much!

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.970
You're shorter than you look on TV!

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.180
Everyone says that.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.680
W-What?! Hitoha!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:50.100
Th-That guy... He was taking upskirt pictures!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.560
What?!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.770
Get him!

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.950
Hitoha, what're you doing here?!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:07.040
Oh! You're here to make fun of me for liking Gachi Rangers!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.040
Up until now I've been lying...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.710
I... I...

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.760
I'm actually a huge Gachi Rangers fan!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:30.390
Let's do it Gachi style!! Yeah!!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.150
I... I'm done practicing!

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:41.200
I'm ruh-rooting... f-f-for you...

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.030
Great!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.030
Thank you so much!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.540
I worried over nothing.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:55.710
It's definitely episode 12's Double-Underhook Gachi Suplex!

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.920
No, it was 17's Flying Gachi Elbow.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.970
Oh yeah, that was cool too.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.090
It was the best.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.890
He had it twisted like this...

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.100
It was more like this.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:11.100
Yeah, yeah!  Good catch!

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.180
Of course.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:16.060
But man, Gachi Pink sure was pretty, huh?

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.820
Be careful not to sneeze on her signature or anything.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:21.740
I won't!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.630
I'm looking forward to the whole-class relay next the most!

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.630
Even though they call it whole-class,

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:47.800
half our runners will have to be Futaba in cosplay.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.510
Won't they figure it out?

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.890
We already did.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.020
C-Class 6-1...

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.230
It's not like we really care.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.060
Even if you do win that way,

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:02.280
we'll all just make fun of you for needing one girl to do all the work.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.490
I was just kidding, you buttwipe!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.870
No one wants to see Futaba cosplaying!

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.330
I brought wigs, though.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:16.040
For the 100 meter, Class 3's got the better average time anyway.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:20.960
Don't you know? Relay races are all about teamwork.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.380
Behold, Class 1!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.050
Hup hup hup hup hup hup...

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.180
Look at those crazy fast baton passes!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.680
I-It's no big deal...

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:34.430
What are you so pumped up for, Ms. Kaieda?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.980
I'm here to take revenge for last week!

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.070
Let's show 'em what Class 3 can do!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.780
Yeah!

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:45.990
Here! Here!

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.910
Catch!

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.370
It broke...

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:55.700
Ouch! Ow!

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.750
Why's it broken?

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.210
Go for it, Oga!

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:05.210
You want it in your mouth?

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.930
Contact established!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:11.100
Oga, give us some too!

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:13.640
Wait!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:14.220
Hey!

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.810
No fair, Oga!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.900
The heck? This is nasty...

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.530
Go get it!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.860
What's your problem?!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.700
It's finally here.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.200
Gross!

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:41.000
H-Hey, the cosplay thing's okay, if you want...

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.460
Shove it, we don't need your pity!

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.590
Can't we change our runners?

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.840
They're already registered...

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.300
This is the work of evil spirits!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:53.300
We just need to use this instead of that baton!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.100
Will you just shut up.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.680
What we'll have to do...

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:00.980
...is find ways to use each person's unique traits.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:07.740
Would all 6th graders participating in the class relay please report to the starting line.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.240
It's time.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.450
First place wins us a comeback victory!

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.660
So just what's our strategy?

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.080
Our strategy is flawless-

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.500
All right, the first leg is all ours!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:30.090
I've... I've got to catch it right.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.180
A scroll?

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.640
Could it be a... LOVE LETTER?!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.230
I've got to hurry and get this to Satou!

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.980
She's so quick!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:48.940
What's this?

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.150
Whatever.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.610
Switch the batons.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.370
This one's just a normal baton...

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.000
That's the scent of a guy who is not Satou!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.500
I kept that thing tucked in my armpit for like an hour.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.840
I gotta pass this off before my body disintegrates!

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.550
Don't get your hopes up!

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:19.390
You damn dumb pretty boy! Love, Chiba.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.770
It's on you now, Hitoha!

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:33.150
Thank you... for running so annoyingly fast.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.120
So slow!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.580
We should have swapped it for a popsicle or something!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.120
No, she'd just have stopped dead and ate it.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.050
What'd you prepare for her?

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:55.430
Her baton's got a secret snapshot of Mitsuba.

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.180
Hold up! How the heck did you get that?!

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.970
By utilizing Hitoha's lack of presence.

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.680
That damn nympho...

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.680
Polaroid Camera

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.520
Whoa, keep it up Sugisaki!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.900
We're back in this!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.940
Go go! Go go!

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:17.950
I won't lose to a class full of deviants!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.580
Blue team wins!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:29.170
Hey, gimme the picture they put on that baton.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.840
Huh? Picture?

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.590
I was too busy running, I didn't even see it!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:36.470
Then how come you were pushing so hard out there?

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.970
Because... you were too slow...

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.850
and I wanted us to win...

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.430
Well done, I was moved!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.980
Ah, thank you!

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:48.440
These kids really can come through when they try!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:50.520
What's that picture?

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.230
Where'd this come from?!

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:57.860
I see, you motivated yourselves with a picture of your student in bloomers, didn't you?

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.240
N-No!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.620
Your whole class is sick!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:19.890
Stone baked sweet potatoes~!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:25.600
This weather sure takes me back to the old days.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:29.140
Yeah, I was just a hopeless kid,

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:32.940
a dog crawling in the gutters, oblivious to the breadth of the skies above,

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.280
searching for a cause.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:39.780
But there are things I learned only because of who I was.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.530
Some potatoes, please.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:43.530
Sure thing!

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:45.910
Aren't you a pretty young lady!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:48.910
How old do you think I am?

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:50.960
Let me see.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:57.760
20... no, 17!

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:59.050
Oh come on!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:01.090
Bingo!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:03.600
Thanks, Miss!

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.560
Thank you so much, Mr. Potato Man!

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.100
There's no tricking my eyes, they've seen it all.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:15.360
It's all in a day's work!

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.240
Hey, do you hear that?

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.820
I don't hear anything.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:22.530
That way!

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:24.530
Go Futaba! Go!

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:26.330
Dash!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.540
What is she, a dog?

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.830
After her!

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:33.920
Hurry!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.960
She's really serious.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.800
Maybe she heard someone screaming?

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:43.430
Stone baked sweet potatoes~!

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.350
Look, I knew it!

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.560
Yeah, I saw that one coming.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.230
Let's get some baked potatoes!

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:52.440
We need money...

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:56.230
but we-are-all-broke, right?

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:00.030
F-Fine, you paupers!

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.530
Yay!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.700
As expected from a loaded nympho!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.080
No way I'm paying for you, Mitsuba!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:10.370
J-Just kidding... Miss Loaded-nympho!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.910
That's basically the same thing.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:16.540
Okay, six taters'll be 1200 yen.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.460
So sweet!

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:21.050
Not too bad for a commoner's treat.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:24.590
If you eat too much, you might have to fart!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.800
I've never farted in my life.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.760
What are you, a TV housewife?

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.980
So all that gas is why you're blown up like this, huh?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.230
Drop dead! Die right now!

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.440
You look as young as ever, miss.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.480
I slipped in an one extra, just for you.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:40.940
Oh, thank you.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.030
Shin's mommy!

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:44.490
Oh, Futaba.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.110
Take care on your way home!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.340
Would you like another, young lady?

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:07.840
But I'm so youthful.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.010
Well yeah.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:14.390
How old would you say Satou's mother actually is?

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.400
Hmm... Let's see...

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.110
Definitely 32.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.150
She's 33.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.150
What?

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:30.780
Are you saying these eyes of mine, trained for 30 years, are wrong?

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.950
One year off, and one free potato.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:37.670
Wh-What about it?

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.130
Well then...

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.000
How old do I look?

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:47.720
I-I-Is she challenging me for a freebie?

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:53.930
Throwing down a challenge to an old hand once feared as a cold-hearted gambler.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:56.850
You've got spunk, young lady!

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.600
Use whatever information you can get.

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:03.820
Those are elementary school backpacks.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.400
First glance tells me they're 4th graders, but...

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:10.030
Wait, that girl in the back can't be that young.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:11.160
Are they 6th graders?

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:14.660
No, she could just as easily be an older girl

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.410
that the younger ones follow around and look up to.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.420
Still...

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.710
She cuts an imposing figure for someone so small...

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:26.550
She must have lived through all manner of chaos and strife.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:30.090
This can't be the aura of a 4th grader!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:34.310
I'll give you a super hint. She's my little sister!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.180
Wh-What did she say?!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.310
If she's younger, then she's in no more than 5th grade.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:44.070
Wait, can I even trust that hint?

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.570
But look,

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.570
those innocent eyes tell nothing but the truth!

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.870
That'll guarantee at least one freebie!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:53.740
Uh oh...

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:59.330
I gotta fart big time!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.170
The eyes of a cheater!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.340
Her true colors came through!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.470
But why say she's younger?

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:16.640
It's a trap to exploit my preconceptions!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:20.230
Saying she's younger forces you to think she's in the 5th grade or lower.

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.310
Meaning...

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:26.320
She wanted me to discount the oldest from the possible choices!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.780
My answer is, you're a 6th grader!

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:32.410
T-Too ba-

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.030
Right.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.160
Yes!

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.870
My skills haven't dulled after all!

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:43.290
That was an intense gamble you came up with, young lady!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.710
But I'm afraid there'll be no freebies for you.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.260
Gamble?

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.380
I just wanted to see how old you thought I was.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.840
I never said anything about betting for free potatoes.

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:59.310
I-It's true... I've acted like a clown,

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.430
getting all worked up!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:03.020
Completely oblivious, spinning my wheels!

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.860
I've been utterly defeated!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:12.900
Poor, pitiful gambler... you've been devoured.

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.740
Devoured by the beast called "gambling," that is.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.120
No wonder you're so addicted.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.870
Half a freebie for everyone!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.250
Take them, you thieves!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.130
Yay!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.340
Thank you, mister!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.380
I didn't think things would turn out so well.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:33.010
I'm sorry.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:36.930
I don't really know how old Satou's mom is.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:39.810
What a scary girl...

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.640
That was close, but I held it in.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:46.860
'Scuse me!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.480
One whole potato for you, on the house!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:51.490
Yippee!

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:57.570
I-I almost ripped one earlier, so gimme more!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:02.000
Gimme half a free potato for every fart!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.460
What a fat pig.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:08.960
Stone baked sweet potatoes~!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.760
I'm glad I came to this neighborhood.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.590
I've learned some of my weaknesses,

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:18.720
and taken one more step towards being a true master gambler...

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.350
Two potatoes, please!

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:22.970
Coming right up!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.940
Aren't you a pretty young lady!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.230
Here you go.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:31.360
Oh you, calling me young...

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:34.240
D-Do I really look that young?

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.910
Her complexion, her skin texture...

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.780
she's in her early 30s.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:42.490
But this is a tricky age to deal with.

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:45.540
Saying the number "30" is out of the question,

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.380
but something in the early 20s

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:51.380
could be just as insulting.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:57.630
This means I need to hit this one right on the line...

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.430
Let me see...

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.470
If I had to guess, I'd say... 29?

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.730
Oh... Was I wrong?

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:11.060
Right on the month, damn it all!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.440
Mr. Potato Man!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.320
One potato, please.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:20.990
You're injured!

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:23.950
Healing Rolling!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.880
Tomorrow... I'll try another town.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.560
Papa...

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:51.270
F-Futaba... You're choking me!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.650
Get the lead out, will you?

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:57.360
The ice cream's gonna melt.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:59.780
Don't put our food on the ground.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.200
I miss the old days.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:08.000
Once upon a time in a little town,

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:11.040
there lived three adorable little girls.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.460
Oh, you all look exactly alike!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.340
We're triplets! We're triplets!

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:18.800
Oh my! And how old are you?

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.350
Wh-Which is it?

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.510
They're four.

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:25.810
Papa!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.940
What a hunk!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:34.270
I was right, I was right!

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:37.070
It must be hard raising three girls.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:37.820
Well...

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.320
Mii gonna carry this one!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.570
Fuu'll carry this one!

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.500
Then Hito get Papa!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.880
Oh, how sweet.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:59.010
Mii get Papa too!

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:00.510
Fuu too!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:07.180
Fuu... Fuu...

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.020
Fuu carry a leg!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.060
Hey, hey.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.270
Whoa.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.270
Futaba, are you okay?

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:19.780
Freeze!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.570
What are you doing to that girl, you monster?!

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:25.820
Come to think of it,

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.370
that was the first time I got taken in for questioning.

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:33.250
Yes, the most adorable set of triplets

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.880
used to live in this neighborhood.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:39.300
Oh? I just moved here, so I never met them.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:42.670
But wouldn't you know, I haven't seen them in years.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:43.800
Good evening.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:45.760
Oh, good evening!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.180
Maybe they moved away?

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.680
Oh, too bad.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:54.060
But in the end, there's no going back.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:01.480
You're hopeless.

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:04.110
You shouldn't be so tired from such a light bag.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:07.160
We can't risk you dropping the eggs and breaking them.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.700
I had a good sleep.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.960
Hey, I wanna help too!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.590
There's nothing to help with.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:20.920
You sleep too much.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.550
That's it!

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.890
I'll carry Papa!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.060
Papa, don't thrash!

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.520
I can't help it-

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.400
What are you doing?

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.280
You're such a handful.

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.360
Bad Papa.

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.240
Girls...

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.320
Let's go.

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:54.080
What's wrong with me...?

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:56.750
My little girls from that day

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:59.580
are still here, right in front of me.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.130
Nothing's changed.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:05.380
They're just a little bigger, a little stronger...

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:06.880
...a little kinder.

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:12.310
Once upon a time in a little town,

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:15.060
there lived three adorable little girls.

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:20.230
And they're still together, in a little town

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:22.940
living happily ever after.

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:43.830
The three-minute rule says this candy's still safe to eat!

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:50.800
Really, aren't you tired of making a fuss about this every time?

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:50.800
Yeah!

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:56.260
Just stop showing me that pretense of kindness

00:22:56.260 --> 00:22:59.520
Will it do good in the long term? You ask

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:01.850
It's none of your business!

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:05.310
Inspection time for all~

00:23:05.310 --> 00:23:07.820
Haven't seen that before? Does it even exist?

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:09.150
Let's check it out!

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:12.280
Everyone's perfectly uniform!

00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:12.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:17.330
That's why we're straying from the path... Hurry!

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:15.320
Go! Go!

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:21.580
It's a good day for new encounters

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:29.750
Next week's sparkling if you feel the weak pulse!

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:36.800
Let's have a good sleep!

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:42.060
Once you're fully rested and recharged

00:23:42.640 --> 00:23:45.980
Let's go backpacking!
